OL,3,GNEWSA'Anxiety' as trust continues into
OL,4,Anew school year
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents and former pupils at schools
OL,7,Frun by a controversial multi-academy
OL,8,Ftrust have raised concerns it is still
OL,9,Fin place as the new school year begins.
OL,11,FIn July the Athena Learning Trust,
OL,12,Fwhich runs nine schools across Devon
OL,13,Fand Cornwall, announced it would
OL,14,Fdissolve and transfer its schools to
OL,15,Fother organisations.
OL,17,FIt came after parents complained about
OL,18,Fthe trust's strict disciplinary
OL,19,Fmeasures which they said had a
OL,20,Fdetrimental impact on pupils' education
OL,21,Fand mental health.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
