OL,3,GNEWSA'Anxiety' as trust continues into
OL,4,Anew school year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust said the transfer processes
OL,7,Fwere under way in partnership with the
OL,8,FDepartment for Education and that
OL,9,F"feedback" had informed changes that
OL,10,Fwould be in place from September.
